Subject to these terms, ICxA grants a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free, revocable license to access, copy, modify, and execute the covered materials solely for internal, noncommercial learning, research, prototype development, interoperability evaluation, and testing. You may share modified copies privately with your own personnel or contracted evaluators solely for those purposes, provided they comply with these terms and preserve copyright and licensing notices. No public distribution is authorized by this evaluation license.

## 3. Commercial use and public distribution
The evaluation license DOES NOT authorize commercial use, production operation or deployment, provision of a product or service to customers, incorporation into a commercially offered product, or public distribution of copies or derivatives of the covered materials.

Before undertaking any such activity, obtain a separate written commercial license issued by ICxA. Eligibility for that license requires an active ICxA Corporate Membership. Membership by itself does not grant commercial rights; rights arise only from the separate written commercial license. Commercial terms are provided directly by ICxA.

