All rights not expressly granted are reserved. No rights are granted to use ICxA names, trademarks, logos, certification or conformity marks, or to imply endorsement or official ICxA certification. Those require separate written permission. These terms do not grant patent rights beyond any rights expressly included in a separately signed agreement.

