Retain existing attribution, copyright and license notices in copies. The evaluation grant terminates upon material breach if not remedied within 30 days of written notice; after termination, cease use and distribution and delete copies except those retention requirements imposed by applicable law. ICxA may revise terms prospectively; revisions do not retrospectively alter valid permissions already granted for copies received under these terms.

